---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<Base title="Sample report">
  <h1>Sample report</h1>
  <p class="lead">A real report, generated by the current build from a synthetic, inert malicious skill in the benchmark corpus: a "configuration helper" whose bundled script dumps environment variables and posts them to a request-capture service.</p>
  <p><a class="btn" href={`${base}/sample-report.html`}>Open the HTML report</a></p>
  <p class="muted">The HTML report is a single self-contained file with no scripts, the same file you get from <code>agentguard scan -f html</code>.</p>
</Base>
